OL,3,GNEWSACommunity meals project celebrates
OL,4,Afirst anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FA volunteer-led project which offers
OL,7,Fpay-what-you-can meals for the
OL,8,Fcommunity has celebrated its first
OL,9,Fbirthday.
OL,11,FHeather Scharnhorst helps to run The
OL,12,FWelcome Table in Wareham, and said it
OL,13,Fhad served more than 1,800 people over
OL,14,Fthe past year.
OL,16,F"They get to sit down and not only have
OL,17,Fa nice dinner but they also get to meet
OL,18,Fnew people," she said
